{"page":392,"verses":[{"verse_key":"28:51","surah":28,"ayah":51,"ar_uthmani":"۞ وَلَقَدْ وَصَّلْنَا لَهُمُ ٱلْقَوْلَ لَعَلَّهُمْ يَتَذَكَّرُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"We have caused Our Word to come to them so that they may be mindful.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"۞ وَلَقَدْ","en_gloss":"And indeed","transliteration":"walaqad","verse_key":"28:51"},{"pos":2,"ar":"وَصَّلْنَا","en_gloss":"We have conveyed","transliteration":"waṣṣalnā","verse_key":"28:51"},{"pos":3,"ar":"لَهُمُ","en_gloss":"to them","transliteration":"lahumu","verse_key":"28:51"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلْقَوْلَ","en_gloss":"the Word","transliteration":"l-qawla","verse_key":"28:51"},{"pos":5,"ar":"لَعَلَّهُمْ","en_gloss":"so that they may","transliteration":"laʿallahum","verse_key":"28:51"},{"pos":6,"ar":"يَتَذَكَّرُونَ","en_gloss":"remember","transliteration":"yatadhakkarūna","verse_key":"28:51"},{"pos":7,"ar":"٥١","en_gloss":"(51)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"28:51"}]},{"verse_key":"28:52","surah":28,"ayah":52,"ar_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ ءَاتَيْنَـٰهُمُ ٱلْكِتَـٰبَ مِن قَبْلِهِۦ هُم بِهِۦ يُؤْمِنُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Those to whom We gave the Scripture before believe in it,","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"Those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"28:52"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ءَاتَيْنَـٰهُمُ","en_gloss":"We gave them","transliteration":"ātaynāhumu","verse_key":"28:52"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلْكِتَـٰبَ","en_gloss":"the Scripture","transliteration":"l-kitāba","verse_key":"28:52"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"before it","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"28:52"},{"pos":5,"ar":"قَبْلِهِۦ","en_gloss":"before it","transliteration":"qablihi","verse_key":"28:52"},{"pos":6,"ar":"هُم","en_gloss":"they","transliteration":"hum","verse_key":"28:52"},{"pos":7,"ar":"بِهِۦ","en_gloss":"in it","transliteration":"bihi","verse_key":"28:52"},{"pos":8,"ar":"يُؤْمِنُونَ","en_gloss":"believe","transliteration":"yu'minūna","verse_key":"28:52"},{"pos":9,"ar":"٥٢","en_gloss":"(52)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"28:52"}]},{"verse_key":"28:53","surah":28,"ayah":53,"ar_uthmani":"وَإِذَا يُتْلَىٰ عَلَيْهِمْ قَالُوٓا۟ ءَامَنَّا بِهِۦٓ إِنَّهُ ٱلْحَقُّ مِن رَّبِّنَآ إِنَّا كُنَّا مِن قَبْلِهِۦ مُسْلِمِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"and, when it is recited to them, say, ‘We believe in it, it is the truth from our Lord. Before it came we had already devoted ourselves to Him.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَإِذَا","en_gloss":"And when","transliteration":"wa-idhā","verse_key":"28:53"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يُتْلَىٰ","en_gloss":"it is recited","transliteration":"yut'lā","verse_key":"28:53"},{"pos":3,"ar":"عَلَيْهِمْ","en_gloss":"to them","transliteration":"ʿalayhim","verse_key":"28:53"},{"pos":4,"ar":"قَالُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"they say","transliteration":"qālū","verse_key":"28:53"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ءَامَنَّا","en_gloss":"We believe","transliteration":"āmannā","verse_key":"28:53"},{"pos":6,"ar":"بِهِۦٓ","en_gloss":"in it","transliteration":"bihi","verse_key":"28:53"},{"pos":7,"ar":"إِنَّهُ","en_gloss":"Indeed, it","transliteration":"innahu","verse_key":"28:53"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱلْحَقُّ","en_gloss":"(is) the truth","transliteration":"l-ḥaqu","verse_key":"28:53"},{"pos":9,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"28:53"},{"pos":10,"ar":"رَّبِّنَآ","en_gloss":"our Lord","transliteration":"rabbinā","verse_key":"28:53"},{"pos":11,"ar":"إِنَّا","en_gloss":"Indeed, we","transliteration":"innā","verse_key":"28:53"},{"pos":12,"ar":"كُنَّا","en_gloss":"[we] were","transliteration":"kunnā","verse_key":"28:53"},{"pos":13,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"before it","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"28:53"},{"pos":14,"ar":"قَبْلِهِۦ","en_gloss":"before it","transliteration":"qablihi","verse_key":"28:53"},{"pos":15,"ar":"مُسْلِمِينَ","en_gloss":"Muslims","transliteration":"mus'limīna","verse_key":"28:53"},{"pos":16,"ar":"٥٣","en_gloss":"(53)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"28:53"}]},{"verse_key":"28:54","surah":28,"ayah":54,"ar_uthmani":"أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ يُؤْتَوْنَ أَجْرَهُم مَّرَّتَيْنِ بِمَا صَبَرُوا۟ وَيَدْرَءُونَ بِٱلْحَسَنَةِ ٱلسَّيِّئَةَ وَمِمَّا رَزَقْنَـٰهُمْ يُنفِقُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"They will be given their rewards twice over because they are steadfast, repel evil with good, give to others out of what We have provided for them,","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","en_gloss":"Those","transliteration":"ulāika","verse_key":"28:54"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يُؤْتَوْنَ","en_gloss":"will be given","transliteration":"yu'tawna","verse_key":"28:54"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَجْرَهُم","en_gloss":"their reward","transliteration":"ajrahum","verse_key":"28:54"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مَّرَّتَيْنِ","en_gloss":"twice","transliteration":"marratayni","verse_key":"28:54"},{"pos":5,"ar":"بِمَا","en_gloss":"because","transliteration":"bimā","verse_key":"28:54"},{"pos":6,"ar":"صَبَرُوا۟","en_gloss":"they are patient","transliteration":"ṣabarū","verse_key":"28:54"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَيَدْرَءُونَ","en_gloss":"and they repel","transliteration":"wayadraūna","verse_key":"28:54"},{"pos":8,"ar":"بِٱلْحَسَنَةِ","en_gloss":"with good ","transliteration":"bil-ḥasanati","verse_key":"28:54"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلسَّيِّئَةَ","en_gloss":"the evil","transliteration":"l-sayi-ata","verse_key":"28:54"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَمِمَّا","en_gloss":"and from what","transliteration":"wamimmā","verse_key":"28:54"},{"pos":11,"ar":"رَزَقْنَـٰهُمْ","en_gloss":"We have provided them","transliteration":"razaqnāhum","verse_key":"28:54"},{"pos":12,"ar":"يُنفِقُونَ","en_gloss":"they spend","transliteration":"yunfiqūna","verse_key":"28:54"},{"pos":13,"ar":"٥٤","en_gloss":"(54)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"28:54"}]},{"verse_key":"28:55","surah":28,"ayah":55,"ar_uthmani":"وَإِذَا سَمِعُوا۟ ٱللَّغْوَ أَعْرَضُوا۟ عَنْهُ وَقَالُوا۟ لَنَآ أَعْمَـٰلُنَا وَلَكُمْ أَعْمَـٰلُكُمْ سَلَـٰمٌ عَلَيْكُمْ لَا نَبْتَغِى ٱلْجَـٰهِلِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"and turn away whenever they hear frivolous talk, saying, ‘We have our deeds and you have yours. Peace be with you! We do not seek the company of ignorant people.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَإِذَا","en_gloss":"And when","transliteration":"wa-idhā","verse_key":"28:55"},{"pos":2,"ar":"سَمِعُوا۟","en_gloss":"they hear","transliteration":"samiʿū","verse_key":"28:55"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱللَّغْوَ","en_gloss":"vain talk","transliteration":"l-laghwa","verse_key":"28:55"},{"pos":4,"ar":"أَعْرَضُوا۟","en_gloss":"they turn away","transliteration":"aʿraḍū","verse_key":"28:55"},{"pos":5,"ar":"عَنْهُ","en_gloss":"from it","transliteration":"ʿanhu","verse_key":"28:55"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَقَالُوا۟","en_gloss":"and say","transliteration":"waqālū","verse_key":"28:55"},{"pos":7,"ar":"لَنَآ","en_gloss":"For us","transliteration":"lanā","verse_key":"28:55"},{"pos":8,"ar":"أَعْمَـٰلُنَا","en_gloss":"our deeds","transliteration":"aʿmālunā","verse_key":"28:55"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَلَكُمْ","en_gloss":"and for you","transliteration":"walakum","verse_key":"28:55"},{"pos":10,"ar":"أَعْمَـٰلُكُمْ","en_gloss":"your deeds","transliteration":"aʿmālukum","verse_key":"28:55"},{"pos":11,"ar":"سَلَـٰمٌ","en_gloss":"Peace (be)","transliteration":"salāmun","verse_key":"28:55"},{"pos":12,"ar":"عَلَيْكُمْ","en_gloss":"on you","transliteration":"ʿalaykum","verse_key":"28:55"},{"pos":13,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"28:55"},{"pos":14,"ar":"نَبْتَغِى","en_gloss":"we seek","transliteration":"nabtaghī","verse_key":"28:55"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ٱلْجَـٰهِلِينَ","en_gloss":"the ignorant","transliteration":"l-jāhilīna","verse_key":"28:55"},{"pos":16,"ar":"٥٥","en_gloss":"(55)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"28:55"}]},{"verse_key":"28:56","surah":28,"ayah":56,"ar_uthmani":"إِنَّكَ لَا تَهْدِى مَنْ أَحْبَبْتَ وَلَـٰكِنَّ ٱللَّهَ يَهْدِى مَن يَشَآءُ ۚ وَهُوَ أَعْلَمُ بِٱلْمُهْتَدِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"You [Prophet] cannot guide everyone you love to the truth; it is God who guides whoever He will: He knows best those who will follow guidance.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"إِنَّكَ","en_gloss":"Indeed, you","transliteration":"innaka","verse_key":"28:56"},{"pos":2,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"(can) not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"28:56"},{"pos":3,"ar":"تَهْدِى","en_gloss":"guide","transliteration":"tahdī","verse_key":"28:56"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مَنْ","en_gloss":"whom","transliteration":"man","verse_key":"28:56"},{"pos":5,"ar":"أَحْبَبْتَ","en_gloss":"you love","transliteration":"aḥbabta","verse_key":"28:56"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَلَـٰكِنَّ","en_gloss":"but","transliteration":"walākinna","verse_key":"28:56"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"28:56"},{"pos":8,"ar":"يَهْدِى","en_gloss":"guides","transliteration":"yahdī","verse_key":"28:56"},{"pos":9,"ar":"مَن","en_gloss":"whom","transliteration":"man","verse_key":"28:56"},{"pos":10,"ar":"يَشَآءُ ۚ","en_gloss":"He wills","transliteration":"yashāu","verse_key":"28:56"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَهُوَ","en_gloss":"And He","transliteration":"wahuwa","verse_key":"28:56"},{"pos":12,"ar":"أَعْلَمُ","en_gloss":"(is) most knowing","transliteration":"aʿlamu","verse_key":"28:56"},{"pos":13,"ar":"بِٱلْمُهْتَدِينَ","en_gloss":"(of) the guided ones","transliteration":"bil-muh'tadīna","verse_key":"28:56"},{"pos":14,"ar":"٥٦","en_gloss":"(56)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"28:56"}]},{"verse_key":"28:57","surah":28,"ayah":57,"ar_uthmani":"وَقَالُوٓا۟ إِن نَّتَّبِعِ ٱلْهُدَىٰ مَعَكَ نُتَخَطَّفْ مِنْ أَرْضِنَآ ۚ أَوَلَمْ نُمَكِّن لَّهُمْ حَرَمًا ءَامِنًا يُجْبَىٰٓ إِلَيْهِ ثَمَرَٰتُ كُلِّ شَىْءٍ رِّزْقًا مِّن لَّدُنَّا وَلَـٰكِنَّ أَكْثَرَهُمْ لَا يَعْلَمُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"They say, ‘If we were to follow guidance with you [Prophet], we would be swept from our land.’ Have We not established for them a secure sanctuary where every kind of produce is brought, as a provision from Us? But most of them do not comprehend.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَقَالُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"And they say","transliteration":"waqālū","verse_key":"28:57"},{"pos":2,"ar":"إِن","en_gloss":"If","transliteration":"in","verse_key":"28:57"},{"pos":